{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19866","headline":"投所知 · 孟郊","name":"投所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦心知苦节，不容一毛发。\n链金索坚贞，洗玉求明洁。\n自慙所业微，功用如鸠拙。\n何殊嫫母颜，对彼寒塘月。\n君存古人心，道出古人辙。\n尽美固可扬，片善亦不遏。\n朝向公卿说，暮向公卿说。\n谁谓黄锺管，化爲君子舌。\n一说清嶰竹，二说变嶰谷。\n三说四说时，寒花拆寒木。\n𣊪𣊪家道路，灿灿我衣\n岂直辉友朋，亦用慰骨肉。\n一暖荷匹素，一饱荷升粟。\n而况大恩恩，此身报得足。\n且将食檗劳，酬之作金刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}